  <div class="no-sub-about-proof__canvas-wrap">
    <canvas id="about-proof-canvas"></canvas>
  </div>
</section>
```

`data-scene="proof"` 유지 (scroll/aria 기존 동작 보존).

---

### Step 2 — SCSS

`resource/scss/pages/_sub.scss`에서 `.no-sub-about-proof__grid`, `__card`, `__body`, `__txt` 블록 제거 후:

